<title>
Brake Lever and Cable Inspection
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Check brake cables for damage and smooth movement. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLJA0A4406001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Replace deteriorated cable(s).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Check tooth tip of each brake lever ratchet notch for damage or wear. If any damage or wear is found, replace parking brake lever.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Check parking brake lever for proper operation and stroke, and adjust it if necessary.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Check: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLJA0A4406002"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Adjust: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLJA0A4406003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</s1>
